---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import IngredientCard from '../../components/IngredientCard.astro';
import FilterTabs from '../../components/FilterTabs.astro';
import { publishedIngredients, pathTo } from '../../lib/content';
const entries = await publishedIngredients();
---
<Layout title="成分図鑑" active="ingredients"><div class="shell"><header class="page-header"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href={pathTo()}>ホーム</a><span>/</span><span>成分図鑑</span></div><p class="eyebrow">INGREDIENT LIBRARY</p><h1><span>成分を知る、</span><span>ケアが変わる。</span></h1><p>美容成分の役割を、出典とともに。気になる名前から、ひとつずつ。</p></header><section class="listing" aria-label="成分一覧"><FilterTabs /><div class="ingredient-grid">{entries.map((entry, index) => <div data-list-category={entry.data.category}><IngredientCard entry={entry} index={index} /></div>)}</div><p class="empty-state" data-list-empty hidden>このカテゴリの成分は、現在準備中です。ケア記事もご覧ください。</p><div class="detail-back"><a class="text-link" href={pathTo('search/')}>成分名やキーワードで検索する →</a></div></section></div></Layout>
